.TH tkmd n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkmd \- Markdown outline viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkmd
.br
set w [::tkutils::tkmd::widget .w]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Tk front-end built on the tclutils Markdown engine (tumd). See docs/tkmd.md.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
tclutils(n)
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, markdown
